=== hash-for-sort-pair-topic
from: Actionable 0.0.7 lib/Actionable.rakumod:256
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method sort
--- code
my %h = name => 'x', description => 'longer text';
my $col1 = %h.keys.map(*.chars).max;
my $col2 = %h.values.map(*.chars).max;
for %h.sort -> $p {
    say $p.key.fmt("%-{$col1}s"), ' | ', $p.value.fmt("%{$col2}s");
}
--- expect
description | longer text
name        |           x

=== hash-for-sort-key-value-destructure
from: HTTP::Tiny 0.2.6 lib/HTTP/Tiny.rakumod:441
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method sort
--- code
my %form = q => 'raku', page => 2, lang => 'en';
my @parts;
for %form.sort -> ( :key($key), :value($v) ) {
    @parts.push: "$key=$v";
}
say @parts.join('&');
--- expect
lang=en&page=2&q=raku

