=== hash-sort-negated-value-head
from: ML::TriesWithFrequencies 0.6.8 lib/ML/TriesWithFrequencies/Trie.rakumod:851
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method sort
--- code
my %res = yes => 7, no => 2, maybe => 4;
