=== hash-sort-negated-subvalue-destructure
from: Terminal::Print 0.978 lib/Terminal/Print/Util/Timing.pm6:51
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method sort
--- code
my %timings = draw => { total => 12, count => 3 }, parse => { total => 40, count => 1 }, io => { total => 7, count => 9 };
