=== hash-antipairs-hash-lookup
from: zef 1.1.4 lib/Zef/CLI.rakumod:760
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method antipairs
--- code
my %meta = provides => { 'Foo::Bar' => 'lib/Foo/Bar.rakumod', 'Foo' => 'lib/Foo.rakumod' };
